{"product_id":"judy-moody-saves-the-world","title":"Judy Moody Saves the World!","description":"\u003cp\u003eJudy Moody Saves the WorldJudy's learning about the environment in class. When she hears about the threats to the rainforest and endangered species ? not to mention her own family's poor recycling habits ? Judy's soon in the mood to whip the planet into shape. She decides that her class needs a way to replace the trees they destroy for pencils. One bottle drive later and they've raised enough money to plant a hundred trees and won the Giraffe award ? for sticking their necks out for a good cause\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 135 x 185\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Megan McDonald | Peter Reynolds\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781406335842\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 160\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45297386553497,"sku":"16RB-1-9781406335842","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/JudyMoodySavestheWorld_MeganMcDonald_PeterReynolds.jpg?v=1744475790","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/judy-moody-saves-the-world","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}